    "standardized_narrative": "The Syndicate recorded a material favourable prior-year development in 2022: a net reassessment (surplus) of GBP 105.98m relating to previous accident years, driven primarily by benign attritional claims experience and reserve releases on 2019 and earlier years (predominantly in Property & Motor, Specialty and Marine & Energy). No gross prior-year aggregate movement was explicitly disclosed; the report quantifies the reassessment on a net basis. Current-year catastrophe activity (Hurricane Ian, Winter Storm Elliot, US Tornadoes and others) and provisions for exposures from the Ukraine War increased volatility but the overall prior-year movement was a release.",
